      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Build geo-tagged, curriculum-aligned outdoor activities in minutes. Students capture evidence in the field, you get real-time progress — no app download required."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-teacher.intro-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "「地理タグ付き、カリキュラムに合わせた野外活動を数分で作成。生徒が現場で証拠を収集し、あなたはリアルタイムの進捗状況を確認できます — アプリダウンロードなしで」",
